        "type": "part",
        "label": "a",
        "prompt": "$$3+10+17+\\cdots+(7n-4)=\\frac{n}{2}(7n-1)\\qquad\\text{for all }n\\geq1.$$",
        "layout": "list",
        "columns": null,
        "questionDiagrams": [],
        "children": [],
        "answer": {
          "short": "True for all integers $n\\geq1$.\n\nIn the inductive step, substitute the assumption and factor $7k^2+13k+6=(k+1)(7k+6)$.",
          "worked": {
            "format": "maths-editor-document-v1",
            "version": 1,
            "blocks": [
              {
                "id": "p17-q2-a-base-heading",
